claim.claim-text:
12. A hybrid propulsion system comprising:
a shaft;
a turbine coupled to the shaft;
an electric motor coupled to the shaft; and
a fuel cell configured to receive compressed air from a compressor and fuel from a fuel source, to provide electrical power to the electric motor, and to provide output gases to the turbine;
wherein the turbine and the electric motor are configured to supply torque to the shaft in parallel,
wherein the fuel cell is positioned within a nacelle having a hollow annular interior separated from and surrounding a cylindrical passageway.
